   "falsifier": "Two consecutive weekly gauge reads after the unified gate lands in which the paperwork-block rate does not fall toward < 0.10 and no loosening lever is applied per the adjustment rule \u2014 the self-tuning claim is then false and the design returns to the ratifying seat.",
   "id": "GOV-0033",
   "number": "0033",
   "owner": "main seat (weekly gauge read); gate machinery owners (step 1); Shawn (step 7 governor click \u2014 executed 2026-10-21 ~22:34Z)",
   "source_blob_sha": "3ff258b9536213ba0cf20f34f9b505dea41f6ac7",
   "statement": "Value = quality x completion; gates protect and never block: work travels one of three doors matched to its blast radius (A full bar 9.5, B one unified paperwork gate at 8.0 with diff-hash freshness, C machine validation via the note door), and a weekly balance gauge tunes the bar on counted numbers.",
