   "falsifier": "A guardian defect-log entry that sits in state DETECTED for more than one shift with no correction in flight and no protected-gate escalation on record \u2014 one such entry, verified in the log, falsifies compliance for that instance; a weekly gauge read whose escape latency is asserted rather than computed from log timestamps falsifies the measurement claim.",
